    "title": "Covington nominated as finalist for 'Best Culinary Town in the South,' vote now - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By CityBeat Staff ,\n1 days ago A magazine covering the American South is holding a competition for “Best Culinary Town in the South,” and Covington has made it to the finals. After thousands of votes were cast during the publication’s initial Readers’ Poll at The Local Palate, Covington advanced from a field of 15 culinary destinations across the South to the final round. Now, you’ve got until 11:59 a.m. on Friday to make Covington the winner. Read full article",
